<div class="fullMedia"><a href="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/60/PostGIS_logo.png" class="internal" title="PostGIS logo.png">PostGIS_logo.png</a> &#8206;<span class="fileInfo">(240 × 240 pixels, file size: 14 KB, MIME type: <span class="mime-type">image/png</span>)</span>
